          "copies/jb107tz1859.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Pencil, no separators: 23 2 22. Region 2 shows the leader label 'WELTE-MIGNON No. 1772 / Kinderscenen 1-6 / R. Schumann / Played by [signature] / 28. III. 09.' - a printed label date, not the punch date. ds710xd1794, whose pencilled roll number is 1773, carries the same five figures, which fits two consecutive rolls punched on one day."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
